# 默认：仓库内与工作区都用 LF，避免 core.autocrlf 造成 "will be replaced by CRLF" 噪音
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本必须是 CRLF，否则 cmd.exe 在某些机器上会解析出错
*.cmd  text eol=crlf
*.bat  text eol=crlf

# C# 与纯文本文档：检出为 CRLF，方便 Windows 上的记事本 / Visual Studio 打开
*.cs   text eol=crlf
*.txt  text eol=crlf

# 二进制：不做任何换行/合并处理
*.mp4  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png  binary
*.ico  binary
*.exe  binary
*.gz   binary
*.7z   binary

# GitHub 语言统计：素材不计入
WhaleTheme/assets/*.mp4 binary linguist-vendored
WhaleTheme/tools/icon-src/*.png binary linguist-vendored
